      "content_layer": "body",
      "formatting": null,
      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "I want to highlight one of the biggest traps I see leaders fall into: assuming that everyone on their team is aligned on what success looks like. The metaphor I like to use for this (inspired by a former colleague) is a silver burrito. Like the ones you see on the Chipotle billboards:",
      "parent": {
