      "self_ref": "#/texts/46",
      "text": "I want to highlight one of the biggest traps I see leaders fall into: assuming that everyone on their team is aligned on what success looks like. The metaphor I like to use for this (inspired by a former colleague) is a silver burrito. Like the ones you see on the Chipotle billboards:"
    },
