      "hyperlink": null,
      "label": "text",
      "meta": null,
      "orig": "That burrito looks delicious because we’re all picturing our favorite burrito inside the silver wrapping. Yum! Similarly, projects often look delicious to team members because they're each imagining different goals — goals that they are personally most excited about (e.g. increase conversion vs. make users happier vs. refactoring code).",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/groups/13"
      },
      "prov": [],
      "self_ref": "#/texts/49",
      "text": "That burrito looks delicious because we’re all picturing our favorite burrito inside the silver wrapping. Yum! Similarly, projects often look delicious to team members because they're each imagining different goals — goals that they are personally most excited about (e.g. increase conversion vs. make users happier vs. refactoring code)."
    },
